<blockquote>
<p>The large majority of our day-to-day readers/voters read for leisure and don't check author posts; your content needs to be compelling without needing you to defend it in several separate discussion posts.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>A fair point. I've written plenty for business audiences, but never for a leisure audience before. I have a lot to learn.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
