<p>I am opinionated. I'll admit. I would suggest that we all are, and that that's not a bad thing.</p>
<p>I'm sticking to things I think of as core. And I've explained why. I'm interested in foundational concepts about how this world works. This idea is simply a tool to help me explore them.</p>
<p>Look, here's my perspective:</p>
